{
  "Arrival: Under the Radar\nAt **Sewer Landing Pad**, let the World 3 arrival finish. Confirm **Under the Radar** is active; keep your World 2 arrival save.": "035f8d7c26f3b2ce",
  "Arrival: Under the Radar\nFrom **Sewer Landing Pad**, go **north** to **Pump Gallery** (`spire_sewers_scale_01`).": "ec1f23a807c783b5",
  "Arrival: Under the Radar\nDefeat the **Sewer Crawler** encounter at **Pump Gallery**. Other enemy parties are separate encounters; heal and clear victory notices before continuing.": "c5125f5e940c66b8",
  "Arrival: Under the Radar\nFrom **Pump Gallery**, go **south** to **Sewer Landing Pad** (`spire_sewers_landing`) → **east** to **Runoff Lock** (`spire_runoff_lock`) → **east** to **Sewer Passage** (`spire_sewers_passage`) → **north** to **Vent Output** (`spire_vent_output`).": "05c809ed0442769e",
  "Arrival: Under the Radar\nFrom **Vent Output**, go **east** to **Underrail Platform** (`spire_underrail_platform`) → **east** to **The Static** (`spire_the_static`).": "7805f88a5c7466f4",
  "Arrival: Under the Radar\nTalk to **Jax** at **The Static**. Finish his introduction and shelter offer. This establishes the borrowed apartment; it does not collect the later heist schedules.": "01ae667053f65bc4",
  "Arrival: Under the Radar\nFrom **The Static**, go **north** to **Signal Stairwell** (`spire_signal_stairwell`) → **north** to **Static Safehouse** (`spire_zekes_apartment`).": "ce8e5c16bf64c015",
  "Arrival: Under the Radar\nTalk to **Zeke** at **Static Safehouse**. Finish the wiring/shield conversation through Orion’s final line. Confirm **Under the Radar** complete and **The Plan** active.": "2e19dcee19198b2a",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nFrom **Static Safehouse**, go **south** to **Signal Stairwell** (`spire_signal_stairwell`) → **south** to **The Static** (`spire_the_static`).": "c72fa5bb49c7cc6c",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nAt **The Static**, use **sign**. Accept/start **Neon Fix**. Its replacement core is carried by a Sentinel upstairs; leave the quest pending for now.": "9a098abe20280b21",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nTalk to **Jax** at **The Static**. Ask for help getting past the patrols and finish the schedule conversation. If a different topic appears, finish or leave it and talk again; verify the schedules task in Journal.": "2e8024f4824cd855",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nFrom **The Static**, go **west** to **Underrail Platform** (`spire_underrail_platform`).": "06d5516005dd7cc1",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nAt **Underrail Platform**, use **patrol timing**. Read the patrol information. It remains rereadable after completion.": "46d5a1e72936e2c1",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nFrom **Underrail Platform**, go **east** to **The Static** (`spire_the_static`) → **south** to **Transit Plaza** (`spire_transit_plaza`) → **south** to **Security Kiosk** (`spire_security_kiosk`).": "31cd3a7e2ba7a03f",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nAt **Security Kiosk**, use **security terminal**. Pull the security records for the plan.": "5fafeeeba2914152",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nFrom **Security Kiosk**, go **north** to **Transit Plaza** (`spire_transit_plaza`) → **east** to **Checkpoint Queue** (`spire_checkpoint_queue`) → **north** to **Elevator Service Gate** (`spire_elevator_service_gate`).": "e84dd7c3ede02cb9",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nAt **Elevator Service Gate**, use **freight badges**. Let Gh0st copy the service authentication pattern.": "0652ea3466354d3b",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nFrom **Elevator Service Gate**, go **south** to **Checkpoint Queue** (`spire_checkpoint_queue`) → **east** to **Night Market** (`spire_night_market`) → **north** to **Lantern Bridge** (`spire_lantern_bridge`).": "277667cf226604a4",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nAt **Lantern Bridge**, use **executive power siphon**. Trace the cable stealing power for the executive billboard. This establishes the investigation for **Night Market Run**.": "1ba250f01bd99729",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nFrom **Lantern Bridge**, go **south** to **Night Market** (`spire_night_market`).": "34502e4fc8d48a0d",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nTalk to **Mika** at **Night Market**. Read her market conversation if available. Inspecting the siphon and using the authored controls can also advance this quest; do not wait for a redundant acceptance dialogue.": "adf5331935c466b7",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nAt **Night Market**, use **lanterns**. Reroute the current after tracing the siphon.": "7b997f3788247ea3",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nAt **Night Market**, use **market registry broadcast**. Finish **Night Market Run**. Check **200 XP + Neon Band**; the band supplies +2 Focus and +5 percentage points of critical chance.": "77c17cc9a4341da0",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nAt **Night Market**, use **open stalls**. See vendors reopening beneath restored lights. Talk to Mika again for her completed-market response. The billboard and occupied-stall register reflect your work.": "c2fa90f14b9274a6",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nFrom **Night Market**, go **west** to **Checkpoint Queue** (`spire_checkpoint_queue`) → **west** to **Transit Plaza** (`spire_transit_plaza`) → **north** to **The Static** (`spire_the_static`) → **north** to **Signal Stairwell** (`spire_signal_stairwell`) → **north** to **Static Safehouse** (`spire_zekes_apartment`) → **north** to **Safehouse Roof** (`spire_safehouse_roof`).": "131526775079f497",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nAt **Safehouse Roof**, use **laundry lines**. Collect the disguise preparation. The exhausted action retires; the room remains accessible.": "94d97101f1b6d831",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nFrom **Safehouse Roof**, go **south** to **Static Safehouse** (`spire_zekes_apartment`).": "a518071700fcfe17",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nAt **Static Safehouse**, use **workstation**. Combine all gathered intelligence. Read the cover: **scheduled Skypark air-filter inspection**. Emergency repairs require a separate incident number; guest deliveries use the concierge.": "3380642e8e8657bd",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nBefore leaving the Lower City, explore its optional branches using the room sweep below if desired. Visit the **Secret Signal Workshop**, subway-car residents and rigging deck for optional conversations; these are not additional heist prerequisites. Keep your current save.": "5f0e409501c150b6",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nAt **Static Safehouse**, use **planning table**. Review the physical route. Choose **Commit the plan and take the service elevator upstairs** when ready; “Keep preparing” leaves you here without launching the heist.": "b7373896e6bfa988",
  "Lower City favors and heist preparation\nThe crew walks back to Transit Plaza in uniform and rides the cleared freight elevator to **Laundry Service**. The Astra relocates separately on autopilot. Confirm **The Plan** complete and **Social Engineering** active.": "310bdfb0146ca538",
  "Upper City access and cover story\nFrom **Laundry Service**, go **north** to **Staff Checkpoint** (`spire_staff_checkpoint`).": "a600ae3a1b9dbe67",
  "Upper City access and cover story\nAt **Staff Checkpoint**, use **badge scanner**. Review the copied service order if needed; this reminder is available even on an older save that missed the new planning dialogue.": "df9cda5b07aa35fc",
  "Upper City access and cover story\nFrom **Staff Checkpoint**, go **east** to **Skypark Dome** (`spire_skypark_dome`).": "92fd2ab15142cae9",
  "Upper City access and cover story\nAt **Skypark Dome**, use **guest registry**. Continue the Curator encounter. When asked for the work order, choose **Scheduled air-filter inspection**. Wrong claims receive a recoverable follow-up; correct the request or step away and retry. Finish Zeke’s line to earn guest access.": "d5e73dbe79c5789f",
  "Upper City access and cover story\nOptional: talk to **Evelyn** and **Robert** here. Sample their topics and one-time gifts if desired. Use their goodbye response or fixed **Leave** button to return to exploration. The gifts are optional; leaving an unfinished gift line does not award it.": "405a8e0406b8ec04",
  "Upper City access and cover story\nFrom **Skypark Dome**, go **west** to **Staff Checkpoint** (`spire_staff_checkpoint`) → **south** to **Laundry Service** (`spire_laundry_service`).": "1590ad32fd8dff81",
  "Upper City access and cover story\nAt **Laundry Service**, use **sensor console**. Finish Zeke and Orion’s scanner work.": "1df9357b3131270a",
  "Upper City access and cover story\nAt **Laundry Service**, use **service chute**. Read the infiltration outcome. Confirm **Social Engineering** complete and **The Lens** active. The next steps finish nearby side quests before taking the Lens.": "8da529bb29a7e62b",
  "Upper City favors: collect the core and case number\nFrom **Laundry Service**, go **south** to **Uniform Sorting** (`spire_uniform_sorting`).": "4aa864ca1eb4a220",
  "Upper City favors: collect the core and case number\nAt **Uniform Sorting**, use **erased memorial name**. Recover the case number for **Cold Case**. Keep it for the trip to the downstairs kiosk.": "b92395d640882a0c",
  "Upper City favors: collect the core and case number\nFrom **Uniform Sorting**, go **south** to **Exec Lounge** (`spire_exec_lounge_bar`) → **south** to **Velvet Hall** (`spire_exec_lounge_scale_01`) → **east** to **Private Booth** (`spire_exec_lounge_scale_02`).": "bd85d8f042a521b4",
  "Upper City favors: collect the core and case number\nAt **Private Booth**, defeat **Sentinel Mk. I** and collect its guaranteed **Neon Sign Core**. If you already own the core, skip the fight for this objective. Clear victory feedback and heal as necessary.": "f470e466e3317abd",
  "Upper City favors: collect the core and case number\nFrom **Private Booth**, go **west** to **Velvet Hall** (`spire_exec_lounge_scale_01`) → **north** to **Exec Lounge** (`spire_exec_lounge_bar`) → **north** to **Uniform Sorting** (`spire_uniform_sorting`) → **east** to **Service Lift** (`spire_service_lift`).": "b0c562921a3b7195",
  "Upper City favors: collect the core and case number\nAt **Service Lift**, use **lift panel**. Ride the cleared city lift to Transit Plaza. You will finish both outstanding return quests on this trip.": "0945449be3e7f32e",
  "One trip downstairs: finish Neon Fix and Cold Case\nFrom **Transit Plaza**, go **north** to **The Static** (`spire_the_static`).": "f2f0221a40cd9fab",
  "One trip downstairs: finish Neon Fix and Cold Case\nTalk to **Jax** at **The Static**. Choose the installation/turn-in conversation with the earned core and finish it. Confirm **Neon Fix** complete: **200 XP**, one core consumed, and the repaired sign. It does not grant a permanent shop discount.": "2dcc4ea45f435afd",
  "One trip downstairs: finish Neon Fix and Cold Case\nIf you joined this route midway and **Night Market Run** is still pending, complete its siphon → lanterns → registry-broadcast sequence now, using the earlier chapter’s directions. Return to The Static afterward before continuing below.": "34eb90640835903d",
  "One trip downstairs: finish Neon Fix and Cold Case\nFrom **The Static**, go **south** to **Transit Plaza** (`spire_transit_plaza`) → **south** to **Security Kiosk** (`spire_security_kiosk`).": "3484c27d4c8778da",
  "One trip downstairs: finish Neon Fix and Cold Case\nAt **Security Kiosk**, use **case records**. Use the recovered memorial case number.": "1d317ef32ba60cfd",
  "One trip downstairs: finish Neon Fix and Cold Case\nAt **Security Kiosk**, use **public kiosk relay**. Expose the transfer and complete **Cold Case**: **200 XP + 2 AP** under crew progression, with Gh0st’s **Intercept** unlocked. Its current effect is self-Guard.": "c2e36b668cc3a8e7",
  "One trip downstairs: finish Neon Fix and Cold Case\nFrom **Security Kiosk**, go **north** to **Transit Plaza** (`spire_transit_plaza`).": "d23a72ca23f053bc",
  "One trip downstairs: finish Neon Fix and Cold Case\nAt **Transit Plaza**, use **elevator controls**. Ride back upstairs to Laundry Service.": "ad7cbd0397f9c1ee",
  "Corporate Espionage: choose one outcome\nFrom **Laundry Service**, go **south** to **Uniform Sorting** (`spire_uniform_sorting`) → **south** to **Exec Lounge** (`spire_exec_lounge_bar`).": "c3e8c95e599ea2c8",
  "Corporate Espionage: choose one outcome\nAt **Exec Lounge**, use **concierge credential mirror**. Copy the next credential.": "4509a4b12b9bff82",
  "Corporate Espionage: choose one outcome\nAt **Exec Lounge**, use **private safe**. Steal the ledger and confirm **Corporate Espionage** is active. Keep a separate save here if you want to compare outcomes.": "54592e6ecd67c884",
  "Corporate Espionage: choose one outcome\nFrom **Exec Lounge**, go **north** to **Uniform Sorting** (`spire_uniform_sorting`) → **east** to **Service Lift** (`spire_service_lift`).": "c91ed1f24ca04791",
  "Corporate Espionage: choose one outcome\nAt **Service Lift**, use **ledger receipts**. Read the two possible uses before transmitting.": "8ed690b2d74ca483",
  "Corporate Espionage: choose one outcome\nChoose **one**: **worker network uplink** publishes the accounts and grants **250 XP + Encrypted Ledger**; **private dead drop** keeps the broader accounts private and grants **250 XP + Phase Rounds**. Either completes **Corporate Espionage**. The other outcome closes; do not try to collect both on one run.": "e7b68404e260df23",
  "Corporate Espionage: choose one outcome\nAt **Service Lift**, use **ledger receipts**. Read the persistent replies: shared worker claims after publication, or one private equipment acknowledgment after leverage. Rereading cannot pay again.": "84dd597c0e23fb13",
  "Murder in the Skyline Salon\nFrom **Service Lift**, go **north** to **Skypark Dome** (`spire_skypark_dome`) → **east** to **Glasswalk** (`spire_glasswalk`) → **east** to **Donor Gallery** (`spire_donor_gallery`) → **east** to **Skyline VIP Salon** (`spire_skyline_vip_suite`).": "ff48a61c97306144",
  "Murder in the Skyline Salon\nAt **Skyline VIP Salon**, use **crime-scene barrier**. Begin the case. The public exit remains open.": "a78392ea81d65a5c",
  "Murder in the Skyline Salon\nQuestion **Dax, Vance, Lyra and Selene**. Note Vance’s claim that he stayed at his corner table from **21:00** onward. You may leave conversations and revisit evidence.": "6b5068cce216ca6d",
  "Murder in the Skyline Salon\nAt **Skyline VIP Salon**, use **dispenser log**. Read when the clean drink was prepared.": "fc035ca0e438d395",
  "Murder in the Skyline Salon\nAt **Skyline VIP Salon**, use **security terminal**. Compare the separate access and equipment records. Do not confuse a coolant vent with proof of movement.": "016f4220b79e065c",
  "Murder in the Skyline Salon\nFrom **Skyline VIP Salon**, go **north** to **Syndicate Booth** (`spire_vip_private_booth`).": "28debb6844aedcf5",
  "Murder in the Skyline Salon\nAt **Syndicate Booth**, use **crystal glass**. Identify the poison residue.": "5efd5bb98010d689",
  "Murder in the Skyline Salon\nAt **Syndicate Booth**, use **executive comms rig**. Compare the missing component and fresh residue.": "952836980d892177",
  "Murder in the Skyline Salon\nAt **Syndicate Booth**, use **auditor's datapad**. Read the optional motive context. This full route includes it, although the three mandatory evidence inspections suffice for confrontation.": "0957eb409bd10ca5",
  "Murder in the Skyline Salon\nFrom **Syndicate Booth**, go **south** to **Skyline VIP Salon** (`spire_skyline_vip_suite`).": "02bae84378325628",
  "Murder in the Skyline Salon\nTalk to **Director Vance** at **Skyline VIP Salon**. Choose **Let’s check your alibi against the records**. Identify **his badge entering the Syndicate Booth at 21:14**, then connect **coolant in the glass with the missing core in his comms rig**. Wrong arguments receive rebuttals and permit retry or leaving. Finish his confession.": "0f76c1cbbd47a888",
  "Murder in the Skyline Salon\nConfirm **Murder in the Skyline Salon** complete: **450 XP + Cyano-Coolant Injector + Skyline Master Passkey**. The passkey is evidence. Review the injector’s actual equipment effects before equipping it; do not assume it overrides every weapon’s element. Save.": "fc12aea02f777b94",
  "Optional exploration sweep before the Lens\nUse the full room sweep below for remaining caches, residents, arcade discovery, the black-site lab and optional **Synchronize Chrono Coils** puzzle. Finish these detours now if you want the escape to stay focused. They do not add main-story prerequisites. Return to the next chapter afterward.": "ca0267fa766f6257",
  "The Lens: containment and acquisition\nFrom **Skyline VIP Salon**, go **west** to **Donor Gallery** (`spire_donor_gallery`) → **south** to **Archive Vault** (`spire_archive_vault`).": "7c821ad9cd290587",
  "The Lens: containment and acquisition\nAt **Archive Vault**, use **containment field**. Read the pressure clue.": "fe363c854e211187",
  "The Lens: containment and acquisition\nAt **Archive Vault**, use **command tether-lines**. Read how the gold authorization circuit reports containment.": "b0f7a6b63ea468e6",
  "The Lens: containment and acquisition\nFrom **Archive Vault**, go **west** to **Prism Gallery** (`spire_prism_gallery`).": "6a5fd96e97b018a6",
  "The Lens: containment and acquisition\nAt **Prism Gallery**, use **prism shutters**. Read the feed/return clue.": "352461f7852f7063",
  "The Lens: containment and acquisition\nAt **Prism Gallery**, use **braided chord**. Route relief into **blue RETURN**, close **red FEED** while keeping RETURN open, then **copy the local hold signal before disconnecting the gold audit**. Wrong routes reset safely; leaving or loading an unsolved attempt permits retry.": "a74ed72b17402c36",
  "The Lens: containment and acquisition\nFrom **Prism Gallery**, go **east** to **Archive Vault** (`spire_archive_vault`).": "87c399a77c8e49fc",
  "The Lens: containment and acquisition\nAt **Archive Vault**, use **lens relic**. Finish Zeke’s warning and Nova’s response. Listen to Thorne and Vale’s escalation. Confirm **The Lens** in inventory and **Burn Notice** active. Keep the pre-Lens save separately.": "8d46c1eff551dbb2",
  "Prototype Testing and rooftop escape\nFrom **Archive Vault**, go **east** to **Drone Test Alcove** (`spire_drone_test_alcove`).": "125756d06949a484",
  "Prototype Testing and rooftop escape\nAt **Drone Test Alcove**, use **prototype targeting audit**. Discover the worker-targeting bias and start/advance **Prototype Testing**.": "39e435f03938b8aa",
  "Prototype Testing and rooftop escape\nAt **Drone Test Alcove**, use **prototype rack**. Run the corrected recorded trial. The worker silhouette passes unharmed; the armed drone target is engaged.": "019b73f9c7f8e4e2",
  "Prototype Testing and rooftop escape\nAt **Drone Test Alcove**, use **trial replay**. Inspect the demonstration again if desired. This is recorded calibration, not a live encounter.": "490234f9467e5a82",
  "Prototype Testing and rooftop escape\nFrom **Drone Test Alcove**, go **east** to **Landing Pad Roof** (`spire_landing_pad_roof`).": "ef1eeec238b906d0",
  "Prototype Testing and rooftop escape\nAt **Landing Pad Roof**, use **test telemetry relay**. Scrub Nova’s signature and complete **Prototype Testing**: **300 XP + Phase Rounds** (+2 Agility, +2 Focus). This is an accessory, not Source weapon conversion. Two copies are legitimate if you also chose private ledger leverage.": "cae5954fa7296c52",
  "Prototype Testing and rooftop escape\nBefore rooftop combat, rest or buy supplies if needed. From Landing Pad Roof, retrace **west** to Drone Test Alcove → **west** to Archive Vault → **north** to Donor Gallery → **west** to Glasswalk → **west** to Skypark Dome → **north** to Orchid Walk → **north** to Registry Pavilion for **Rest**. Return by reversing those directions. Exec Lounge also has the Upper City Lounge shop. Do not use up your only predeparture save.": "295a9dbb03fe3ead",
  "Prototype Testing and rooftop escape\nAt **Landing Pad Roof**, defeat the **Aero Drone / Heavy Mech** party and then the **Administrator / Aero Drone** party as they become available. They are separate encounters. Recover between them if needed; defeating one party does not mean all rooftop security is cleared.": "08bd7d99bb974483",
  "Prototype Testing and rooftop escape\nAt **Landing Pad Roof**, use **shield window**. Use the Lens/Scan timing to identify the local security-curtain opening. This is not the removal of the planetary Shield.": "6c9667197885eff8",
  "Completion checkpoint: stop before launch\nCheck Journal for all six completed side quests: **Neon Fix, Cold Case, Night Market Run, Corporate Espionage, Prototype Testing, Murder in the Skyline Salon**. Confirm **Under the Radar, The Plan, Social Engineering, The Lens** complete, with **Burn Notice** awaiting departure. Skip already-completed objectives; use the earlier chapter for any missing quest.": "5b0798ec33bceb97",
  "Completion checkpoint: stop before launch\nIf pursuing every room and collectible, finish the room sweep below before leaving. Check fishing/arcade/optional-puzzle discoveries against their actual journals and inventory. You do not need both ledger branches. Save in a separate slot and retain it after departure.": "3c217e6c7b0391d1",
  "Completion checkpoint: stop before launch\nAt **Landing Pad Roof**, use **launch window**. Depart only after the completion checkpoint. Finish the escape sequence and confirm **Burn Notice** completes on arrival in World 4. The Foundry is below the outer Shield; high-orbit hardware is still missing.": "9f02d804355233cf"
}
